<b><i>Explorer: Lv 1</i></b>

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:17.850
<i>Simply fighting bare-handed 
isn't good enough.</i>

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.400
<i>But I don't know how long it'll take 
if we fight bare-handed from the start.</i>

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.730
<i>I'll start with the killing blow only.</i>

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:27.410
<i>Durandal one-shots monsters, so...</i>

