00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.720
You have all kinds of weapons.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.990
I'll try this sword next.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.610
<i>I don't mind going at a turtle's pace.</i>

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:40.830
<i>Slow and steady does it.</i>

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:47.090
Lowering my weapon's strength by 
one level makes it ineffective?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:50.880
Watch out, Rox—

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.600
Huh?

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:01.240
<i>She's dodging all the monster's attacks.</i>

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:03.600
<i>At first glance, it seems like 
she's barely dodging them,</i>

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.160
<i>but it's actually the other way around.</i>

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.460
<i>Large movements are inefficient.</i>

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.560
<i>Look, dodge, and attack.</i>

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:17.400
<i>It's like a magnificent dance.</i>

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.790
<i>Don't get distracted.</i>

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.300
<i>Now I just have to finish 
it off with punches.</i>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.890
<b><i>Warrior: Lv 10</i></b>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.890
<b><i>Swordsman: Lv 8</i></b>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.890
<b><i>Villager: Lv 5</i></b>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.890
<b><i>Thief: Lv 3</i></b>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.890
<b><i>Merchant: Lv 1</i></b>

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.710
Huh? It's not there?

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.810
<b><i>Party Job Settings</i></b>

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.810
<b><i>Kaga Michio
Roxanne</i></b>

