<b><i>Farmer: Lv 1
 Warrior: Lv 1
 Swordsman: Lv 1
 Explorer: Lv 1
 Monk: Lv 1</i></b>

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.500
Roxanne, did you kill it?

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:49.820
Yes, Master. It was defeated when 
I struck it after you punched it.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:53.440
Impressive work. 
You dodged all its attacks, too.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:55.450
Because we had it surrounded.

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:59.670
And those attacks can be dodged 
easily if you're watching closely.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:00.700
<i>Yeah, I don't think so.</i>

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.360
I'll finish off the next one.

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:06.510
Roxanne, just help me 
flank it and don't attack.

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:07.710
Understood.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.390
This way.

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.790
<i>If I want to get its health as low as 
possible with a single sword attack,</i>

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.590
<i>then I need to adjust my Strength stat.</i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i><b>Status</b></i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i><b>Kaga Michio</b></i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i><b>Endurance</b></i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i><b>Spirit</b></i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i><b>Strength</b></i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i><b>Intelligence</b></i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i><b>Agility</b></i>

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.440
<i>Forty-five.</i>

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.310
<i>That was too much.</i>

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.600
<i>How about 20?</i>

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.770
<i>Thirteen, maybe?</i>

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.910
<i>Okay, it wasn't defeated.</i>

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:37.490
Roxanne.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:38.910
I know.

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.660
<i>Character Settings.</i>

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.240
