00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.240
<i><b>Kaga Michio</b></i>

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.240
<i><b>Endurance</b></i>

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.240
<i><b>Spirit</b></i>

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.240
<i><b>Strength</b></i>

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.240
<i><b>Intelligence</b></i>

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.240
<i><b>Agility</b></i>

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:45.540
<i>I'll unequip my Bonus Weapons and put all 
my points in increasing my Strength stat.</i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
<i><b>Status</b></i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
<i><b>Kaga Michio</b></i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
<i><b>Endurance</b></i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
<i><b>Spirit</b></i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
<i><b>Strength</b></i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
<i><b>Intelligence</b></i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
<i><b>Agility</b></i>

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:49.830
<i>Now I'll pour everything I've 
got into this single blow.</i>

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.320
<i>It noticed me?</i>

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:54.550
<i>Either way, I'm too close 
to evade its attack.</i>

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.220
<i>So I'll keep pushing forward.</i>

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.310
I-I'm impressed.

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:10.940
You killed it in a single blow.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.320
<i><b>Character Settings</b></i>

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.320
<i><b>Kaga Michio
Roxanne</b></i>

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.320
<i><b>Monk: Lv 1</b></i>

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.320
<i><b>Effect: Minor Spirit Increase</b></i>

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.320
<i><b>Effect: Tiny MP Increase</b></i>

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.320
<i><b>Skill: Treat Wounds</b></i>

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:14.320
<i>That took forever.</i>

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.220
<i>Treat Wounds.</i>

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.250
The pain went away.

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:27.080
From now on, I'll use my skill to 
heal us if we're damaged by monsters.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.320
You can do that?

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.330
<b><i>Farmer: Lv 1
 Warrior: Lv 1
